WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:01.420
- You went to your childhood home.

00:00:01.420 --> 00:00:02.577
Is that kind of special for you?

00:00:02.577 --> 00:00:03.941
Where you grew up?

00:00:03.941 --> 00:00:08.869
- I try to go there often,
just because it's nostalgic

00:00:08.869 --> 00:00:11.440
for me, and I've gone every year.

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:13.667
Well, there's me.

00:00:13.667 --> 00:00:17.550
I grew up there; everything
started from there.

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:19.730
I actually got to knock on the door,

00:00:19.730 --> 00:00:22.135
and someone was finally there,
because no one's ever there.

00:00:22.135 --> 00:00:25.217
It was just this chill
dude and he was like,

00:00:25.217 --> 00:00:26.400
"Yeah, come look around."

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:27.803
He was so unfazed that I was there.

00:00:27.803 --> 00:00:30.813
He was like, "Yeah, apparently
you wrote on this wall."

00:00:30.813 --> 00:00:35.079
"Also there's a crib in
the garage if you want it."

00:00:35.079 --> 00:00:36.270
- [Kelly] What?

00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:37.381
- I was like, "My crib?"

00:00:37.381 --> 00:00:38.515
He was like, "Yeah."

00:00:38.515 --> 00:00:39.920
I was like, "My crib is in your garage?"

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:40.900
He goes, "Yeah."

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:42.530
I was like, "Can I have it?"

00:00:42.530 --> 00:00:43.363
He goes, "Sure!"

00:00:43.363 --> 00:00:44.540
I'm like...

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:47.540
He has all this stuff, and
I had written in the closets

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:50.240
that I was in love with Cole Sprouse.

00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:52.075
- [Kelly] I am older
than you; who is that?

00:00:52.075 --> 00:00:53.710
(cheering)

00:00:53.710 --> 00:00:56.315
- Cole Sprouse was on Suite
Life of Zack and Cody.

00:00:56.315 --> 00:00:57.563
- Okay, I know that.

00:00:57.563 --> 00:00:59.250
- I was obsessed with that show.

00:00:59.250 --> 00:01:02.279
I thought that we were
gonna be together one day.

00:01:02.279 --> 00:01:03.742
(laughter)

00:01:03.742 --> 00:01:07.418
Then I guest starred on the
show, but I kissed his brother,

00:01:07.418 --> 00:01:09.214
and I didn't get to kiss Cole.

00:01:09.214 --> 00:01:10.790
- [Crowd] Awww...

00:01:10.790 --> 00:01:11.720
- I always feel bad for y'all.

00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:12.773
I hate acting.

00:01:13.977 --> 00:01:15.360
I don't know how you
do, you don't know where

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:16.290
their mouths have been.
- It was my first kiss.

00:01:16.290 --> 00:01:18.120
- Oh my gosh!
- Yeah.

00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:21.213
- Your first kiss was with
a stranger and an actor?

00:01:21.213 --> 00:01:22.955
- On camera. (laughing)
- That's fine.

00:01:22.955 --> 00:01:23.788
Oh my god!

00:01:25.074 --> 00:01:25.930
- It was one of the worst days of my life.

00:01:25.930 --> 00:01:28.250
- You know what, mine wasn't
acting and it wasn't camera,

00:01:28.250 --> 00:01:29.839
mine was horrible.

00:01:29.839 --> 00:01:31.119
It was like he was searching
for something with his tongue.

00:01:31.119 --> 00:01:32.414
- Oh god.

00:01:32.414 --> 00:01:33.693
(crowd gasping)

00:01:33.693 --> 00:01:34.693
- I was like, there's nothing
in there, it's just my mouth.

00:01:34.693 --> 00:01:37.780
And then I literally went
and spit in his bathroom.

00:01:37.780 --> 00:01:38.613
It was horrible.

